 presence. This solution was then mixed with an equal volume of the other phase (B) at 80 rpm for 8 h and then equilibrated overnight. The phase A was then carefully separated from phase B. The Ru content was determined using an ICP-MS apparatus and comparing the results with the Ru references. The evaluation of the complexes was repeated three times and the ratio between the organic and aqueous phase calculated."}]}